  "name": "Chenega Corporation Lands Resources",
  "description": "Data Type: Multi-Resources; Series of automated maps recording ANCSA & S12(a) and S12(b) conveyances, anadramous streams, timber stands, habitat, subsistence areas (including marine mammal haul-out areas); Aleut place names, S17(b) easements, oil spill impacted beaches, mineralogy, land planning and use areas all specific to Chenega Corporation lands.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Unknown",
